                    <msContents>
                        <summary>Report on the visit of Defence Minister Relus ter Beek to the Defence Minister of the <choice>
                                <abbr>FRG</abbr>
                                <expan>Federal Republic of Germany</expan>
                            </choice> Gerhard Stoltenberg, and the possible implications of German reunification for the banking situation in Germany, <choice>
                                <abbr>NATO</abbr>
                                <expan>North Atlantic Treaty Organization</expan>
                            </choice> cooperation, and the <choice>
                                <abbr>CSCE</abbr>
                                <expan>Conference on Security and Co-operation in Europe</expan>
                            </choice> discussions with the Soviets.</summary>
                    </msContents>
                    <history>
                        <origin when="1990-02-08">8.2.1990</origin>
                    </history>
                </msDesc>
